Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.83,Doc,,0,0,0,,Imagine this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:02.59,Doc,,0,0,0,,You buy a brand-new BYD.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.64,0:00:03.39,Doc,,0,0,0,,A few months later,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.44,0:00:07.43,Doc,,0,0,0,,you hit a kangaroo on the motorway\Nat 110 kilometres an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:09.19,Doc,,0,0,0,,Your insurance accepts the claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.24,0:00:10.37,Doc,,0,0,0,,The parts are ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.42,0:00:11.89,Doc,,0,0,0,,And then… nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.94,0:00:15.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,Eleven weeks later, your car is\Nstill sitting at the smash repairer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.14,0:00:19.01,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the supplier tells you the missing\Nparts are another eight weeks away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.06,0:00:20.43,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's not a made-up story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.48,0:00:24.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,It's what one BYD owner described\Npublicly on an Aussie car forum in early
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.84,0:00:27.31,Doc,,0,0,0,,2025 and it wasn't the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:30.17,Doc,,0,0,0,,Parts delays, calls that go unanswered,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.22,0:00:33.31,Doc,,0,0,0,,and long waits just to get a car looked\Nat became some of the most common
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.36,0:00:35.65,Doc,,0,0,0,,complaints in BYD owner groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.70,0:00:38.67,Doc,,0,0,0,,Today, BYD is one of the\Nbiggest car brands in Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:40.63,Doc,,0,0,0,,So what went wrong after the sale?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:44.15,Doc,,0,0,0,,How expensive is a BYD to\Nrepair and insure, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:46.25,Doc,,0,0,0,,And has BYD actually fixed it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.30,0:00:50.29,Doc,,0,0,0,,Because in October 2026, BYD\Nmade a very big announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.34,0:00:51.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,Stay with me to the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.58,0:00:54.82,Doc,,0,0,0,,because what it means for you\Ndepends on which BYD you drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:00:57.69,Doc,,0,0,0,,First, let's understand\Nhow fast this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:02.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD arrived in Australia with one\Nmodel, the Atto 3 electric SUV.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.58,0:01:04.37,Doc,,0,0,0,,Within a few years, it had a full range:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:08.21,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Dolphin, the Seal, the\NSealion 6 and Sealion 7,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:15.07,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Shark 6 ute, and now even a budget\NEV, the Atto 1, priced from $19,990.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:20.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,In the first half of 2026, BYD sold\Nmore than 52,000 cars in Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:23.19,Doc,,0,0,0,,In March, it broke into the top\Nthree brands in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.24,0:01:28.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,By October, BYD said it had more\Nthan 150,000 customers here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.14,0:01:29.47,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's incredible growth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:33.00,Doc,,0,0,0,,But it created a problem that every\Nfast-growing brand eventually hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.05,0:01:34.93,Doc,,0,0,0,,Selling cars is one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.98,0:01:36.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,Fixing them is another.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.58,0:01:39.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,Every one of those 150,000\Ncars will need servicing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.93,0:01:43.93,Doc,,0,0,0,,tyres, windscreens, and\Nsooner or later crash repairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.98,0:01:47.30,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the network to support them\Ndidn't grow as fast as the sales did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:49.30,Doc,,0,0,0,,Let's start with parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.35,0:01:53.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,Australia is a small market compared\Nto China, Europe or the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.96,0:01:55.57,Doc,,0,0,0,,When a part isn't stocked locally,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.62,0:01:58.35,Doc,,0,0,0,,it has to be shipped, and\Nthat can take weeks or months.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:01.29,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD's own executives have\Nbeen open about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.34,0:02:05.15,Doc,,0,0,0,,When Stephen Collins took over as BYD\NAustralia's chief operating officer,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.20,0:02:08.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,he spoke publicly about how the brand\Nneeded to shake off its reputation for
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.86,0:02:11.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,long service and parts delays.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.14,0:02:14.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,CarsGuide reported that months-long\Nparts delays and unanswered emails and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.90,0:02:17.95,Doc,,0,0,0,,calls were among the most common\Ncomplaints in owner groups,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:20.69,Doc,,0,0,0,,with some posts attracting\Nthousands of responses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.74,0:02:22.17,Doc,,0,0,0,,And there was another issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:25.59,Doc,,0,0,0,,Mark Harland, the boss of\NBYD's premium brand Denza,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.64,0:02:27.25,Doc,,0,0,0,,admitted that in the early days,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.30,0:02:30.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,even basic things like repair training\Nand the right tools weren't in place
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.84,0:02:31.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.82,0:02:33.45,Doc,,0,0,0,,Even if a workshop had the part,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:35.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,did they have the training\Nto fit it on an EV?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:36.62,Doc,,0,0,0,,Not always.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.39,0:02:40.40,Doc,,0,0,0,,Now, to be fair, this\Nisn't only a BYD problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.45,0:02:41.39,Doc,,0,0,0,,In July 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.44,0:02:45.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Australian Automotive Dealer Association\Nreleased an independent review by
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.93,0:02:48.00,Doc,,0,0,0,,Emeritus Professor Jenny Buchan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.05,0:02:51.54,Doc,,0,0,0,,The review found that customers across\Nthe industry face long delays to get
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.59,0:02:54.78,Doc,,0,0,0,,their cars fixed especially\Nelectric vehicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.83,0:02:57.96,Doc,,0,0,0,,Dealers told the review that workshop\Nbacklogs could stretch to six to eight
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.01,0:03:00.00,Doc,,0,0,0,,weeks just to diagnose a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.05,0:03:00.84,Doc,,0,0,0,,Not fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.89,0:03:02.38,Doc,,0,0,0,,Just find out what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.43,0:03:04.42,Doc,,0,0,0,,Combine that with slow parts and, often,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.47,0:03:08.66,Doc,,0,0,0,,no loan car, and owners can be left\Nwithout transport for a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.71,0:03:12.06,Doc,,0,0,0,,The report also pointed\Nat the wave of new brands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.11,0:03:15.58,Doc,,0,0,0,,Australia has more than seventy car\Nbrands competing for around 1.2 million
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.63,0:03:16.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,sales a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.03,0:03:21.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,Denza, Geely, IM Motors and\NGAC have all arrived recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.27,0:03:23.40,Doc,,0,0,0,,Not all of them have the parts warehouses,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.45,0:03:26.84,Doc,,0,0,0,,trained technicians and dealer networks\Nthat the long-established brands built
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.89,0:03:27.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,over decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.79,0:03:30.10,Doc,,0,0,0,,So what about cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.15,0:03:33.86,Doc,,0,0,0,,You'll see lots of scary numbers\Nonline about BYD repair bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.91,0:03:36.38,Doc,,0,0,0,,Here's what we can actually back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.43,0:03:40.82,Doc,,0,0,0,,EVs and plug-in hybrids are generally\Nmore expensive to repair after a crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.87,0:03:44.90,Doc,,0,0,0,,A senior figure in BYD's collision\Nrepair network told the industry magazine
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.95,0:03:49.00,Doc,,0,0,0,,Paint and Panel that EV repair costs\Ncurrently sit in a category more like
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.05,0:03:50.16,Doc,,0,0,0,,high-end luxury cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.21,0:03:52.64,Doc,,0,0,0,,That pushes insurance premiums up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.69,0:03:55.32,Doc,,0,0,0,,The battery is the big\None if it's badly damaged,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.37,0:03:56.40,Doc,,0,0,0,,a car can be written off,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.45,0:03:59.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,because the battery is such a\Nlarge share of the car's value.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.77,0:04:01.42,Doc,,0,0,0,,It's not just the battery, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.47,0:04:02.74,Doc,,0,0,0,,Take the Shark 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.79,0:04:04.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,A rear bumper isn't just plastic anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.93,0:04:07.86,Doc,,0,0,0,,It carries the reversing\Ncamera and parking sensors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:11.46,Doc,,0,0,0,,A low-speed car park bump that used\Nto cost a few hundred dollars can turn
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.51,0:04:13.94,Doc,,0,0,0,,into new sensors plus recalibration.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.99,0:04:16.26,Doc,,0,0,0,,But here's the part a\Nlot of videos leave out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:20.23,Doc,,0,0,0,,Insurance comparison site Compare the\NMarket quoted twenty popular hybrids,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.28,0:04:22.68,Doc,,0,0,0,,plug-ins and EVs across eleven insurers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.73,0:04:28.76,Doc,,0,0,0,,The BYD Dolphin averaged about\N$1,425 a year less than a Toyota
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.81,0:04:29.90,Doc,,0,0,0,,Corolla hybrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.95,0:04:33.00,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Sealion 7 came in\Njust under a RAV4 hybrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.05,0:04:36.96,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Shark 6 was higher,\Nat around $2,071 a year,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.01,0:04:40.78,Doc,,0,0,0,,but still well below the two\NTeslas, which were over $3,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.83,0:04:41.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,So the honest answer is:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:46.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD repairs can cost more than an old\Npetrol car, especially for crash damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.03,0:04:51.00,Doc,,0,0,0,,But BYD insurance isn't automatically\Nmore expensive than its Japanese rivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.05,0:04:53.11,Doc,,0,0,0,,It depends heavily on the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.92,0:04:56.63,Doc,,0,0,0,,Before we get to BYD's fix, quick favour.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.68,0:05:00.13,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you own a BYD or you're thinking\Nabout buying one tell me in the comments
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.18,0:05:02.69,Doc,,0,0,0,,what your service and\Nrepair experience has been.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.74,0:05:03.63,Doc,,0,0,0,,Good or bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.68,0:05:05.93,Doc,,0,0,0,,Your experience helps\Nother Aussies decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.98,0:05:10.17,Doc,,0,0,0,,And if you want honest, fact-checked\Ncar videos for Australia, hit subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.22,0:05:12.76,Doc,,0,0,0,,It costs nothing and it\Nkeeps this channel going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:15.17,Doc,,0,0,0,,There's one more thing worth mentioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.22,0:05:21.25,Doc,,0,0,0,,In 2026, BYD recalled 32,009 Shark 6\Nutes in Australia because of possible
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.30,0:05:23.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,abnormal wear in the spare wheel assembly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:27.61,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD advised affected owners to remove\Nthe spare wheel if they wanted to keep
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.66,0:05:29.33,Doc,,0,0,0,,driving before the fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.38,0:05:33.05,Doc,,0,0,0,,Recalls happen to every brand\NToyota, Ford, all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:35.27,Doc,,0,0,0,,A recall is actually the system working.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.32,0:05:39.17,Doc,,0,0,0,,But for a brand already fighting a\Nreputation for slow after-sales support,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.22,0:05:42.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,a recall of more than thirty thousand\Nutes adds pressure on dealers and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.58,0:05:44.32,Doc,,0,0,0,,workshops that were already busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.11,0:05:47.40,Doc,,0,0,0,,So, has BYD done anything about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.45,0:05:49.84,Doc,,0,0,0,,Yes and it's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.89,0:05:52.20,Doc,,0,0,0,,On the 20th of October 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.25,0:05:57.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD Australia announced that it now\Nholds more than 580,000 parts for BYD and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.13,0:05:59.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,Denza models on Australian soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.27,0:06:03.48,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's around 95 per cent of the parts\Nfor both ranges, kept in stock locally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:07.40,Doc,,0,0,0,,The value of those parts is more\Nthan $25 million at any time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.45,0:06:11.34,Doc,,0,0,0,,spread across more than 24,000 square\Nmetres of warehouses in four cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:13.30,Doc,,0,0,0,,The biggest is in Melbourne,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.35,0:06:16.83,Doc,,0,0,0,,with about 15,000 square metres\Nand a team of around forty people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:20.61,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD says dealers close to a warehouse\Nshould get in-stock parts within
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.66,0:06:24.50,Doc,,0,0,0,,twenty-four hours, and remote or\Nrural areas within about a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.55,0:06:28.78,Doc,,0,0,0,,Importantly, BYD says it now keeps\NBlade battery packs in local stock and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.83,0:06:32.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,batteries are one of the slowest parts\Nto get when they have to come by ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.49,0:06:36.00,Doc,,0,0,0,,Chief operating officer Stephen Collins\Nsummed up the message like this:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.05,0:06:39.32,Doc,,0,0,0,,"Our commitment to Australian\Ncustomers doesn't end at the handover.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.37,0:06:43.58,Doc,,0,0,0,,It starts there." BYD also set up its\Nown approved collision repair network
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:46.94,Doc,,0,0,0,,early, and many of those shops\Nwere already trained on Teslas,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.99,0:06:49.46,Doc,,0,0,0,,so they had the EV\Nequipment and experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.51,0:06:50.75,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's a smart shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.49,0:06:53.80,Doc,,0,0,0,,Now, if you're stuck waiting\Non a repair right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:55.80,Doc,,0,0,0,,here's something every Aussie should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.85,0:06:57.70,Doc,,0,0,0,,Under the Australian Consumer Law,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.75,0:07:01.24,Doc,,0,0,0,,manufacturers and importers must make\Nspare parts and repair facilities
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:04.62,Doc,,0,0,0,,available for a reasonable\Ntime after you buy a product.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.67,0:07:07.92,Doc,,0,0,0,,That applies even if you didn't\Nbuy it directly from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.97,0:07:10.92,Doc,,0,0,0,,The problem, as the dealer\Nassociation's review pointed out,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.97,0:07:13.00,Doc,,0,0,0,,is that "reasonable" is vague.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.05,0:07:14.94,Doc,,0,0,0,,The review called for clearer rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.99,0:07:17.82,Doc,,0,0,0,,including on battery\Ndegradation and replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.87,0:07:18.84,Doc,,0,0,0,,Until that happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.89,0:07:21.74,Doc,,0,0,0,,the best thing you can do is\Nkeep everything in writing,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.79,0:07:25.60,Doc,,0,0,0,,contact the manufacturer's head office\Ndirectly not just the dealer and if it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.65,0:07:28.50,Doc,,0,0,0,,drags on, go to your\Nstate's fair trading office.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.55,0:07:32.24,Doc,,0,0,0,,There's also the Motor Vehicle Service\Nand Repair Information Sharing Scheme,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.29,0:07:34.16,Doc,,0,0,0,,which came in from 2022.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.21,0:07:38.34,Doc,,0,0,0,,It requires car makers to share repair\Ninformation with independent workshops.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.39,0:07:42.26,Doc,,0,0,0,,But the Insurance Council has raised\Nconcerns that some brands still restrict
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.31,0:07:43.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,parts sales to their own dealers,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.93,0:07:46.95,Doc,,0,0,0,,which limits how many workshops\Ncan actually do the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.69,0:07:50.20,Doc,,0,0,0,,So, is BYD's repair problem real?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.25,0:07:50.69,Doc,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.74,0:07:53.74,Doc,,0,0,0,,Owners waited far too long\Nfor parts in the early years,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:55.84,Doc,,0,0,0,,and the brand itself has admitted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.89,0:07:58.36,Doc,,0,0,0,,Are BYD cars more expensive to repair?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.41,0:08:00.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,For crash damage on EVs and plug-ins,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.58,0:08:05.02,Doc,,0,0,0,,usually yes but insurance on models\Nlike the Dolphin and Sealion 7 is
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.07,0:08:08.64,Doc,,0,0,0,,competitive, and sometimes cheaper\Nthan the Toyota equivalent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.69,0:08:10.14,Doc,,0,0,0,,And has it been fixed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.19,0:08:14.78,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD has put real money into the\Nproblem $25 million of parts and four
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.83,0:08:18.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,warehouses is not a press\Nrelease with nothing behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.13,0:08:21.30,Doc,,0,0,0,,The real test is whether owners notice\Nthe difference over the next twelve
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.35,0:08:21.76,Doc,,0,0,0,,months.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.81,0:08:25.26,Doc,,0,0,0,,Because a warehouse full of parts\Nonly helps if the workshops,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.31,0:08:28.06,Doc,,0,0,0,,the technicians and the\Nphone lines keep up too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.11,0:08:31.52,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you're buying a BYD today,\Nask the dealer three questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.57,0:08:33.78,Doc,,0,0,0,,Where is the nearest\Napproved collision repairer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:35.92,Doc,,0,0,0,,How long are current service bookings?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.97,0:08:38.52,Doc,,0,0,0,,And what's the loan car policy\Nif the car is off the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.57,0:08:41.27,Doc,,0,0,0,,The answers will tell you\Nmore than any brochure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.01,0:08:45.66,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's the full, honest story of\NBYD's repair problem in Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.71,0:08:46.62,Doc,,0,0,0,,If this helped you,
